  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - Bebeka Coffee Plantation Development Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">&#xc9;thiopie - Projet de d&#xe9;veloppement de la plantation de caf&#xe9; Bebeka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to achieve the following objectives : i) to increase Ethiopia&apos;s foreign exchange earnings through coffee production for export ; and ii) to create job opportunities for the unemployed ; and improve the living standards and social lives of such people through the provision of certain amenities.</narrative>
